        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Continuous Semantic Zoom Smoke Test\n\nThis graph has five authored Views at **0.15, 0.35, 0.70, 1, and 2**. Resolution **3** opens the complete graph. Open a second copy alongside and zoom the workspace to watch the first copy change.\n\nUse **Enter test bench** to inspect the authored View nodes and expected behavior."
        },
