        "identity": {
          "graphId": "semantic-zoom-resolution-smoke"
        },
        "markdown": "## Five authored Views\n\nThis graph itself is the fixture. In the workspace, open a second copy alongside it, leave one copy unfocused, then zoom through its thresholds. The displayed View should change at 0.15, 0.35, 0.70, 1, and 2. At resolution 3 it becomes the full graph.\n\nThe glyph is the fallback below the first threshold. The full graph still keeps ports, handles, and its membrane."
      },
